## Real-time Prediction

A real-time prediction demo was included in the script. When provided with an unlabeled array of sensor readings, the best performing model successfully outputted a predicted state along with class probabilities.

```
Input Sensor Data:
Voltage (V)                      3.9
Current (A)                      1.8
Temperature (°C)                30.5
Internal Resistance (mOhm)      25.0
SOC (%)                         75.0
Cycle Count                    400.0
Capacity (mAh)                2600.0

Predicted Health Status: **DEGRADING**
```

